      "title": {
        "en": "Skilled veterinary care with ownership shifts"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Numerous long-time pet parents praise the compassionate attention provided by doctors such as Dr. Osvaldo, noting thorough examinations and warmth during routine visits. Conversely, several critical reviews mention recent ownership and staffing transitions, citing less personal care and disagreements over treatment protocols."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 13,
      "title": {
        "en": "Successful interventions alongside critical outcomes"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients regularly credit the clinic with resolving difficult skin allergies, performing successful C-sections, and stabilizing critical emergency cases. However, some pet parents express deep grief and frustration over sudden clinical deteriorations or procedures that ended tragically."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 13,
      "title": {
        "en": "Detailed clinical guidance and front-desk friction"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Satisfied reviewers appreciate daily telephone updates during hospitalizations and detailed procedural walkthroughs from attending veterinarians. Other pet owners report communication breakdowns with reception staff, unclear diagnostics, or insufficient explanations prior to sedation."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
